<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - ARM FINANCIAL STARTED.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - ARM FINANCIAL STARTED.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oppenheimer &amp; Co said it initiated coverage of ARM Financial Group Inc as an outperform.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- ARM Financial was unchanged at 20-1/2 on the American Stock Exchange.</p>
